fvibzJllPMdgAqG1TvicycPK5xxpI6k503Kum3rHALiac/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/kmsKUE2j2Tic5Ars1sDflsjib6O36sOhXRHFVfA38XsaiaumiaC5vmWG3Z0AJtGpsYNH5O4gywb2uicephWganCgqqTTicf4AncbuZDn1jic477Fho/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/kmsKUE2j2TibrdaNwKK8SItIrpmUCM3HDFzBNbond1Mq1U3vV6fQAESIqD27hbg5bkUuqRvL0EuCbBnJoMIwk4MkZlgn0wFbpgTQK4k48uxQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>三  申请条件</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span>1、政治思想品德优秀、身心健康。</span></p><p><span>2、学业成绩优秀，原则上总评成绩在同年级同专业排名前50%，或在学术研究和科技创新方面有突出表现的学生。</span></p><p><span>3、国内高校化学、化工、材料、食品类等相关专业2027届本科毕业生均可报名。</span></p><p><span>4、对学术研究有浓厚兴趣，愿意从事学术研究。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>四  申请材料</span></span><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span>学生申请参加夏令营需准备以下材料（按以下顺序整合为1个PDF文件，并以“院校+本人姓名”命名）</span></p><p><span>1、《2026年广东工业大学轻工化工学学院夏令营申请表》（附件1），须加盖本科院系公章或教务章。</span></p><p><span>2、《广东工业大学轻工化工学院慕研夏令营安全知情同意书》1份（附件2）</span></p><p><span>3、身份证与学生证（身份证正反面扫描在1个A4页面内；学生证将个人信息页和注册信息页扫描在1个A4页面内），扫描电子版；</span></p><p><span>4、本科阶段成绩单1份（原件）须盖有教务部门或院系公章。</span></p><p><span>5、其他材料，如获奖证书及代表性学术成果，扫描电子版。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>五  申请流程</span></span><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span>1、报名时间：即日起至2026年6月22日24:00前</span></p><p><span>2、线上报名：营员于2026年6月22日24:00前扫描下方二维码填写报名问卷，并上传整理好的PDF版资料。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/kmsKUE2j2T9m96UVXy1vleAb2vIodGt8nEiaflqiabMicIPM6nDFicSJtaTzK2U9RYyXyONqWTvj34WZshCLkLAkgX1NDkGia0D3ej01dU8WGeic0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>3、加入咨询群：报名材料上传成功后加入qq交流群，加群时请备注“院校+本人姓名”，如“广东工业大学-张三”经审核后入群。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/kmsKUE2j2TibyJexbU8bmek8GHIVnw0UJaWESNHOD00eaJOUh8UfWrlF03RVR5kic0E9DJzMWNXNBwicxF9wEyS5hyWWSf2c1wTCls8y2s604w/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>六  材料审核及选拔</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>1、对照申请条件，学院研究生工作办公室对申请人的材料进行形式审查。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2、学院招生领导小组对形式审查合格的申请材料进行综合评议，择优确定夏令营入营名单。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3、学院研究生工作办公室于2026年6月下旬在学院网站公布夏令营入营名单。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4、获得入营资格的申请人须在规定时间内确认参营，逾期未确认视为自动放弃参营资格</span></span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>七  活动费用</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>主办单位将提供活动期间的交通，异地学生可提供2人间住宿、往返广州的交通费用补贴（报销标准为往返广州汽车、高铁二等座、普通列硬座标准，凭有效票据可报）。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>八  联系方式</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>地址：广东工业大学大学城校区工学四号馆201-1</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系人：项老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系电话：020-39318653</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>附件1</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/OnKmAg75_TUSTgw4UIVkbA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>广东工业大学轻化学院2026年“慕研”夏令营活动申请表</span></a></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>附件2</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/OnKmAg75_TUSTgw4UIVkbA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>广东工业大学轻工化工学院“慕研”夏令营安全知情同意书</span></a></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>END</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>图文 | 轻工化工学院</span></p><p><span>排版 | 王连平</span></p><p><span>初审 | 刘夏宁 曾竞颐</span></p><p><span>复审 | 项浩晟 张昊昀</span></p><p><span>终审 | 杨　刚 何   军</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/kmsKUE2j2TibUTQdIdELLjHZicWZ2wribicfqY4mBCficCHpEZ0ucQic0862rMia2kAFr7kBa30fPWk9xQ1kiaBFB76J1iaF989AHdqxYTqDXVCCt0ME/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section alt=\"\" title=\"\"><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/pSpRHqA4tTKaL7KK15jLiajrIKHSI6Sb5BF4kAhjfCkicBavx6LQ16fiaqE931ozibTVJicEHQdlY1F2zxmXvbibiaVFQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"901d97c8026ae049018c762e57b7a218b2551e3ccf24457596c310112c364c91","textLength":2128,"sourceSha256":"ac604e09d31d6472d303eaf0b254ac1401d6c356884f216da4a388d0c7def4d3","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-c70705b5968ccf5ea498","title":"2026年广东工业大学轻工化工学院2026年“慕研”夏令营报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:06.296819+00:00"}
